1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bexh%C3%B6vede '''Wikipedia: Bexhövede'''] is a town in the Cuxhaven district of Lower Saxony, Germany which was incorporated into the municipality of Loxstedt in 1974. It is well kno
2 CONC wn for being the origin of the noble [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Buxhoeveden_family '''Buxhoeveden'''] family.
2 CONT
