2 CONT http://geneal.lemmel.at/Buxh-18e.html '''Albert v. Buxhoevede – miles, auf Bramel und Donnern (Adalbert von Jerichow and Gudela von Jerichow (von Stade) are believed to be incorrect parents)
2 CONT
2 CONT However, https://www.kristense.au/OurFamily/wc04/wc04_193.html, gives Albert and Gudela von Jerichow as Albert 1's parents. This is also a family website. It cites many sources, but difficult to see which of them specifically supp
2 CONC orts the notion that the von Jerichows were Albert's parents. Lateral thinking and more research may be needed!
2 CONT
2 CONT Also see https;//family.buxhoeveden.net/index.php?route=%2Ftree%2Fbuxhoeveden%2Ffamily%2F0097200973%2FRitter-Albert-de-Bekeshovede-Aleides-de-Bederkesa
