1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://daten.digitale-sammlungen.de/bsb00000345/image_599.           II
2 CONT https://www.digitale-sammlungen.de/en/view/bsb00000600?page=412 II
2 CONT https://www.digitale-sammlungen.de/en/view/bsb00000600?page=413 ad. II
2 CONT http://genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00389828&tree=LEO
2 CONT ----
2 CONT "... Jan (Hans) von Tiesenhausen, who in 1269 [probably 1279] based on feudal law had to receive Kokenhausen castle from his bride Zofia (Sophia), princess of Polotsk, widow after knight Dietrich, who was killed in a battle near A
2 CONC schauden in 1279, became a progenitor of the all remaining branches of Tyzenhauses and from him also the Kossakowski Latvian-Lithuanian main strain is derived..."
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: Golden Book of Polish Nobility, (Złota księga szlachty polskiéj), by Teodor Żychliński, a 31-volumed work based on nobility documents, published during several years at the end of 19th century.
2 CONT
2 CONT Knight banneret ?, archbishop's vassal, Alvericus s.35; GHBR Estland I, s.395-396; GHdA 27, Freiherren A IV, p. 383-384, Dominus, miles, vasall of archbiscop of Riga., Riikan arkkipiispan vasalli, ritari
2 CONT
2 CONT * http://www.wbc.poznan.pl/dlibra/applet?mimetype=image%2Fx.djvu&sec=false&handler=djvu_html5&content_url=%2FContent%2F77564%2Fdirectory.djvu&p=198
2 CONT
2 CONT There are mistakes in death date, associated with this profile, mentioned in several various sources. This is the logical sequence of the events:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Princess Sophia of Polotsk marries knight Dietrich.<br/>
2 CONT 2. Knight Dietrich is killed in the battle Aschauden (1279?).<br/>
2 CONT 3. Widowed Sophia of Polotsk marries Hans von Tiesenhausen.<br/>
2 CONT 4. Tiesenhausen's mother is older than 55 when she gives birth to his son.  <br/>
2 CONT 5. Hans von Tiesenhausen receives as his bride's dowry castle of Kokene (property of Sophia's mother).<br/>
2 CONT 6. Hans von Tiesenhausen and Sophia have children, who are founders of Tyzenhausen and Kossakowski dynasties.<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT --
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother's date of birth estimated as 1170, so maybe that needs to be adjusted upwards.
