2 CONT
2 CONT ===FRIEDRICH von Büren===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''FRIEDRICH von Büren''', son of FRIEDRICH von Büren & his wife Hildegard --- ([1050]-1105 before 21 Jul, bur Lorsch Monastery). 
2 CONT *m (betrothed Regensburg 24 Mar 1079, 1089) as her first husband, '''AGNES of Germany''', daughter of Emperor HEINRICH IV King of Germany 
2 CONT *Duke Friedrich & his wife had [twelve] children:
2 CONT *1.         [HEILIKA von Staufen (-after 1110, bur Kloster Ensdorf). 
2 CONT *2.         BERTRADA [Bertha] von Staufen .  The primary source which confirms her parentage and marriage has not yet been identified.  m ADALBERT, Graf.
2 CONT *3.         FRIEDRICH von Staufen (1090-Alzey 4 or 6 Apr 1147, bur Walburg Abbey). He succeeded his father as FRIEDRICH II "der Einäugige" Duke of Swabia in 1105. m firstly ([1119/21]) JUDITH of Bavaria, daughter of HEINRICH "dem 
2 CONC Schwarzen" Duke of Bavaria [Welf] & his wife Wulfhild of Saxony [Billung] m secondly ([1132/33]) AGNES von Saarbrücken, daughter of FRIEDRICH I von Saarbrücken Graf im Saargau & his wife Gisela
2 CONT *4.         HILDEGARDIS von Staufen .
2 CONT *5.         '''KONRAD von Staufen''' (1093-Bamberg 15 Feb 1152, bur Bamberg Cathedral).  The primary source which confirms his parentage has not yet been identified.  He was elected in 1138 as KONRAD III King of Germany. 
2 CONT *6.         GISELA von Staufen [Giselhildis].  
2 CONT *7.         HEINRICH von Staufen (-before 1102).
2 CONT *8.         BEATRIX von Staufen (-after 1146). 
2 CONT *9.         KUNIGUNDE [Kunizza] von Staufen .  The primary source which confirms her parentage and marriage has not yet been identified.  m HEINRICH, Herzog.
2 CONT *10.      SOPHIA von Staufen .  The primary source which confirms her parentage and marriage has not yet been identified.  m ADALBERT, Graf.
2 CONT *11.      GERTRUD von Staufen (-after 1182). m ([1127]) HERMANN von Stahleck Graf von Stahleck, son of GOSWIN Graf von Stahleck & his wife Luitgard von Heimbach (-Ebrach 2 Oct 1156, bur Ebrach, transferred to Bildhausen).  He was 
2 CONC installed in [1138] as HERMANN III Pfalzgraf von Lothringen by his brother-in-law Konrad III King of Germany, resigned in 1155.] 
2 CONT *12.      RICHILDE von Staufen ([1100]-). m (after 1117) as his second wife, HUGUES "Cholet" Comte de Roucy, son of EBLES [II] Comte de Roucy & his wife Sibylle of Apulia ([1090]-[1160], bur Reims St Thierry). 
2 CONT
2 CONT ------------------------------------------------
