2 CONT F1. [1m.] Boleslaw III "Krzywousty" "Wrymouth", Ct of Poland (1102-11)+(1111-39), Duke of Pomerania (1122-38), *20.8.1085, +28.10.1138; 1m: 1103 Zbyslava of Kiev (+1109/12); 2m: III/VII.1115 Salome (+1144) dau.of Gf Heinrich von B
2 CONC erg-Schelkingen; Before his death arranged a careful division of his domains among his numerous sons.
2 CONT *G1. [1m.] '''Wladyslaw II "Wygnaniec", Pr of Cracow and Silesia (1139-46), *1105, +Altenburg 30.5.1159, bur Pegau nr Altenburg'''; m.1125/27 Agnes of Austria (+1160/63); for his issue see HERE
