2 CONT >'''Predecessor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/Albert-the-Bear-Count-of-Anhalt-Duke-of-Saxony-Markgrave-of-Brandenburg/6000000001593637951 Albert the Bear] '''Successor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/Otto-II-Markgraf-von-Branden
