1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Stephen III Arpád, King of Hungary (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #114051, b. 1147, d. 1172
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=27 May 2003
2 CONT
2 CONT Consanguinity Index=0.1%
2 CONT
2 CONT      Stephen III Arpád, King of Hungary was born in 1147. (1) He was the son of Geisa II Arpád, King of Hungary and Euphrosine of Novgorod. (2) He married Agnes Babenberg, daughter of Heinrich II Jasomirgott Herzog von Österreich 
2 CONC and Theodora Comnene, in 1167. (1) He died in 1172. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT      Stephen III Arpád, King of Hungary gained the title of King Stephen III of Hungary in 1161. (2)
2 CONT
2 CONT Forrás:
2 CONT
