2 CONT Q: The family von Tisenhausen's family-news also interprets Sophia von Kokenhusen!  Not a v. Hoya. Would it be appropriate to correct the daughter of Sophia - "to the right of the father" - Theodericus von  Kokenhausen?
2 CONT
2 CONT A: No. Sophia is from Kokenhusen because of she is from Kokenhuse, daugher of knigh of Principality of Koknese Wetseke (Viachko).
