2 CONC Theodoricus and the Tiesenhausen family about the grant of the castles Kokenhusen and Berson; a document in Latin from 1254 in which Bishop Johan of Riga acknowledges the grant to Sophie of Kokenhusen with property of the the coun
2 CONC ts of Holstein in Germany. Sophie was the wife to Jo-hannes Tiesenhausen the son of Engelbrecht.
