2 CONT xx ([early] 1106) LEOPOLD III "der Heilige" Markgraf of Austria, s/o LIUTPOLD II Markgraf of Austria & Ida [von Ratelberg] ([1075]-killed while hunting 15 Nov 1136, bur Stift Klosterneuburg )
2 CONT *1.LEOPOLD 2. HEINRICH 3.BERTA  4.AGNES 5.OTTO 6. KONRAD 7.ELISABETH 8.JUDITH 9. ERNST 10. GERTRUD 11. [UTA 12. ?[7 children died young 
