2 CONT Vladimir II Monomakh, Prince of Novgorod and Kiev was the son of Vsevolod I, Grand Duke of Kiev and Irene (?). (2), (3) He married Gytha (?), daughter of Harold II Godwinson, King of England and Eadgyth Swanneshals (?). (1)
2 CONT
