2 CONT
2 CONT Vladimir II Monomakh, Prince of Novgorod and Kiev gained the title of Prince Vladimir of Kiev. He gained the title of Prince Vladimir of Novgorod. (1) He succeeded to the title of Grand Duke Vladmir II of Kiev in 1113. (2)
