2 CONT Iaroslav (-1123), Prince of Volynia  married three times - to Hungarian, Polish, and Kievan princesses In consequence of Iaroslav's early death, his descendants forfeited any right to the Kievan throne and had to content themselve
2 CONC s with Turov  and Pinsk. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Maria, married Piotr Wlostowic.
