2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Ramon Berenguer II, Count of Provence
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT There he met Richeza of Poland, the daughter of the exiled Polish high duke, Ladislaus II. He married her on 17 November and on the return journey, his uncle died.
2 CONT
2 CONT He resumed the war with Genoa, but died trying to take Nice in the spring of 1166. His daughter, Douce, succeeded him, while widow Richeza married Raymond V of Toulouse.
2 CONT
