2 CONT      Vratislav I, King of Bohemia was born in 1032. (2) He was the son of Bretislav I, Duke of Bohemia. (1) He married Swatawa Piast, daughter of Casimir I, Duke of Poland and Dobronega Maria of Kiev, in 1063.2 He died in 1092. (1
2 CONC )
2 CONT
2 CONT      Vratislav I, King of Bohemia was a member of the House of Premysl. (1) He succeeded to the title of Duke Vratislav II of Bohemia in 1061. (1) He was created King Vratislav I of Bohemia in 1085. (1)
