2 CONT      Geisa II Arpád, King of Hungary was born circa 1130. (2) He was the son of Béla II Arpád, King of Hungary and Helen of Serbia. (2) He married Euphrosine of Novgorod, daughter of Mstislaw I, Grand Prince of Kiev, in 1146. (2) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1161. (2)
2 CONT
2 CONT      Geisa II Arpád, King of Hungary gained the title of King Geisa II of Hungary in 1141. (2)
