2 CONT
2 CONT      Heinrich I Graf von Wettin was born before 27 February 1142. He was the son of Conrad Markgraf von Meißen and Luitgarde von Swabia. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Sophie von Sommerschenburg, daughter of Friedrich von Sommerschenburg, Pflazgraf von Sommerschenburg and Luitgarde von Stade, circa 1182. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 30 August 1181.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Heinrich I Graf von Wettin gained the title of Graf von Wettin.
