2 CONT *1.         VITALE Michieli [II] (-1172, bur San Zaccheria). .. ... <br> m ---.  The name of Vitale´s wife is not known. Vitale & his wife had two children
2 CONT ** a)         LEONARDO Michieli (-[1172]). .. <br> m ([1155/72]) --- of Serbia, daughter of DESA Grand Župan of Serbia & his wife ---. ..
2 CONT
2 CONT **b)         '''NICCOLÒ Michieli''' .  The Annales Venetici Breves name "comitis Nicolay, filio Vitalis Michaelis ducis" and records his marriage to "neptiam regis [Ungarie] nomine reginam Mariam".  The Historia Ducum Veneticorum 
2 CONC names "alter quoque illius [=Vitale Michael] filius…Nicholaus comes Arbensis", after his brother Leonardo, and his marriage to "Ladisclavi regis Ungarici filiam".  Patrician of Venice.  Governor of Arbe. <br> '''m''' ([before 1165
2 CONC /Dec 1167]) MARIA of Hungary, daughter of LÁSZLÓ of Hungary [later LÁSZLÓ II King of Hungary] & Judyta of Poland ([1147/48]-).  The Annales Venetici Breves name "comitis Nicolay, filio Vitalis Michaelis ducis" and records his marr
2 CONC iage to "neptiam regis [Ungarie] nomine reginam Mariam"[186].  Andrea Dandulo´s Chronicon Venetum records that "Nicolao…ducis nato" married "Arbæ comiti Mariam filiam Ladislai de stirpe regali".  If her affiliation is correct, she
2 CONC  must have been born when her parents were very young. 
2 CONT
