1 NOTE {geni:about_me} RATIBOR (-before 1276).  "Mestwinus…princeps in Danzk" donated "inter Radunam…et Stolpam…quatuor villas…Svcowia…Mislicyn…Svlislaue…Barcline" to Kloster Zuckau, with the consent of "filiorum meorum…Swantopolco, Wart
2 CONC izlao, Samborio, Ratiborio…et uxoris nostre", by charter dated 24 Apr 1209[377].  "Swantopolcus princeps de Gdanizo" confirmed donations to Kloster Oliva, witnessed by "Wartizlaus, Samborius et Ratiborius fratres mei…"[378].  "Rat
2 CONC iborius…princeps…terre Slauenisis" donated property to the Knights of the Order of St John by charter dated 1223[379].  Herzog von Belgard.  "Samborius de Liubesou et…Suuantopolcus de Gdanzk" donated property to Kloster Oliva, for
2 CONC  the souls of "fratris nostri Wartislaui…", by charter dated 27 Dec 1229, subscribed by "Ratiborius dux de Belgard…"[380].  Knight of the Teutonic Order 1269.  m (before 1240) ---, sister of TETISLAUS ---.  The primary source whic
2 CONC h confirms her marriage and family origin has not yet been identified.  
2 CONT
