1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Andrey Glebovich - according to historian Boguslavsky, prince of Ryazan, the eldest son of Gleb Rostislavich, the prince of Ryazan, and Euphrosyne (Evfrosinya) Rostislavna, daughter of Pereyaslav prince Rostislav Y
2 CONC urievich.
