1 TITL prince
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Vsevolod Glebovich''' (died in 1207) - prince of Pronsk and Kolomna. Principle Prince of Pronsk, from Rurk Xth generation.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Biography'''
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1180, with the support of Vsevolod "the Big Nest", together with his brother Vladimir, he opposed the elder brothers Roman of Ryazan and Igor. Then, together with his younger brother Svyatoslav, he ruled the Principality of Pro
2 CONC nsk. In 1186, Roman, in alliance with Igor and Vladimir, laid siege to Pronsk and forced the city to surrender. Svyatoslav obeyed his older brothers. Vsevolod settled in Kolomna for 2 years, but then, with the support of Vladimir,
2 CONC  returned to Pronsk.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Family'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * Father: Gleb Rostislavich (d. 1178) - Prince of Ryazan (1145-1177 intermittently).
2 CONT * Mother: Euphrosyne (Evfrosinya) Rostislavna (d. 1179) - daughter of Rostislav Yurievich.
2 CONT
2 CONT Brothers and sisters:
2 CONT
2 CONT * Andrey? (d. before 1186) - mentioned only once before Roman Glebovich in the annals of 1184, although Roman was a prince of Ryazan from 1178 to 1207.
2 CONT * Roman (d. 1216) - Grand Duke of Ryazan (1180-1207).
2 CONT * Igor (d. 1195) - Principle Prince of Ryazan.
2 CONT * Theodosia - married to Mstislav "the Brave".
2 CONT * Vladimir (d. after 1186) - Prince of Pronsk (1180-before 1186).
2 CONT * Svyatoslav (d. after 1207) - Principle Prince of Pronsk.
2 CONT * Yaroslav (d. after 1199) - Prince of Ryazan.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT # Kir-Michael (d. 1217) - Prince of Pronsk (1207-1217 intermittently).
