2 CONC ic de Trois-Fontaines names "Agnetam" as second of the three daughters of "Raynaldus de Castellione uxor…relictam principis Raymundi" and her husband "rex Bela de Hungaria"[754].  The Lignages d'Outremer name "Maria e Joanna" as t
2 CONC he two daughters of "Rinaldo de Castellion" and his wife "Costanza…la Nova Princessa", stating that Marie married "el re d'Ungaria", "Maria" presumably being an error for "Agnes"[755].  She lived at the court of Emperor Manuel I[7
