2 CONT      Helen Arpád was the daughter of Geisa II Arpád, King of Hungary and Euphrosine of Novgorod. (2), (1) She married Leopold V Herzog von Österreich, son of Heinrich II Jasomirgott Herzog von Österreich and Theodora Comnene, in 1
2 CONC 172. (1) She died in 1199. (1)
