2 CONT Leopold V, Duke of Austria
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Leopold was the son of Henry II Jasomirgott and his Byzantine wife Theodora Comnena. In 1172 he married Helena, daughter of King Géza II of Hungary, and their sons were Frederick I and Leopold VI.
2 CONT
2 CONT Helena (c. 1158 – 25 May 1199), wife of Duke Leopold V of Austria.
