1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Het Geschlacht says 1444. From DAS GESCHLECHT LÜNING, Teil 1.The Schlichthorster line of von Luininck stems from '''Dietrich, Chancellor in the early Duchy of Kleve, Mark von Ravensburg'''. Translation help from Lu
