2 CONT Fromhold Vietinghoff († 1510) was survived by his widow and their minor sons. The widow Lena Hans' daughter Kalff married for the third time (her first marriage was to Wolmar Alen) to Heinrich Hastfer, owner of Rohu and Einmanni K
2 CONC orps, who is also mentioned as the owner of Kehtna at the beginning of the 16th century († 1518). (In 1518, the son Reinhold Hastfer borrowed money from Heinrich Treyden to pay his father's debts and put some money on Kehtna. Then
2 CONC  the widow Lena Kalff († 1547), who had already buried three men, married for the fourth time to Otto Ungern, owner of Paunküla.
