1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Adelsvapen ==
2 CONT #'''According to Adelsvapen, first''', it is written that [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Wrangel_af_Adinal_nr_199 Woldemar Woldemarsson Wrangel. till Adinals]'s wife is '''Dorty Maydell'''. Probably a mistake, meaning Dorot
2 CONC hy., Dorothea, or something like that. 
2 CONT #'''Next it is stated''' that "Dorty" is a daughter to [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Maydell_nr_102 Johan Maydell and his wife Eufemia von Nieroth]. If this is true, then the parents of the '''Dorty''' are misplaced. 
2 CONT #'''It is further written''' that, before Eufemia von Nieroth was married to Johan Maydell, she first was married to '''Johan Wrangel, till Reps''' (von Wrangell till Reps).
2 CONT
2 CONT == Genealogischen Handbuch der baltischen Ritterschaften ==
