2 CONT Herman Wrangel (1584 or 1587 – December 11, 1643) was a Swedish soldier and politician of Baltic German extraction. He was appointed Field Marshal in 1621, Privy Councillor in 1630, and Governor General of Livonia in 1643. He was 
2 CONC also the father of Carl Gustaf Wrangel.<br/>
2 CONT <br/>https://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Herman_Wrangel
