1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Richenza (also spelled as Richeza or Richza) (c. 1025 – before 1083) was a German noblewoman. By her first marriage, she was Countess of Werl. By her second marriage, she was Countess of Northeim, and from 1061 to 
2 CONC 1070, Duchess of Bavaria.
2 CONT
2 CONT She is known as Richenza of Swabia based on the theory that she was a daughter of Duke Otto II of Swabia. However, that theory is hard to maintain with the current state of research.
2 CONT * [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Richenza_of_Swabia '''Wikipedia: Richenza of Swabia''']
