1 OCCU Herzogin von Niederlothringen, Landgräfin von Brabant, Gräfin von Brüssel, comtesse de Louvain
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Luitgarde von Sulzbach, Herzogin von Nieder-Lothringen1
2 CONT
2 CONT b. circa 1115, d. circa 1162
2 CONT
2 CONT Father	Berenger II, Graf von Sulzbach b. circa 1080, d. 3 December 1125
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother	Adelheid von Dießen b. circa 1084, d. 11 January 1126
2 CONT
2 CONT      Luitgarde von Sulzbach, Herzogin von Nieder-Lothringen was the daughter of Grafen Berengar II von Sulzbach and his second wife Adelheid von Dießen, daughter of Graf Otto II von Ambras.1 Countess of Dagsburg.1 She was born cir
2 CONC ca 1115 at Sulzbach, Germany.1 She was the daughter of Berenger II, Graf von Sulzbach and Adelheid von Dießen. Luitgarde von Sulzbach, Herzogin von Nieder-Lothringen married Godefroid II, comte de Louvain, duc de Lothier, son of G
2 CONC ottfried I "der Bärtige", Herzog von Brabant and Ida de Chiny de Namur, in 1139; Her 1st.1,2 Luitgarde von Sulzbach, Herzogin von Nieder-Lothringen married Hugo X, Graf von Egisheim-Dagsburg, Herr von Mora, son of Hugo IX, Graf vo
2 CONC n Egisheim-Dagsburg, after 1143; Her 2nd (widow).1,2 Luitgarde von Sulzbach, Herzogin von Nieder-Lothringen died circa 1162.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Family 1
2 CONT
2 CONT Godefroid II, comte de Louvain, duc de Lothier b. 1107, d. between 11 November 1142 and 31 December 1142
2 CONT
2 CONT Child	
2 CONT
2 CONT Gottfried III, Graf von Löwen+ b. 1142, d. 10 Aug 1190
2 CONT
2 CONT Family 2
2 CONT
2 CONT Hugo X, Graf von Egisheim-Dagsburg, Herr von Mora b. circa 1118?, d. 1178
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Luitgarde was the sister of Gertrude von Sulzbach, wife of Conrad III of Germany, and of  Bertha, wife of Manuel I Comnenus, the Eastern Roman (Byzantine) Emperor. 
