2 CONT Until 1143, he was married to Gertrude of Süpplingenburg, the daughter of Emperor Lothar II. In 1148 he married Theodora Comnena, a niece of the Byzantine Emperor Manuel I. Both marriages strongly show the importance of the House 
2 CONC of Babenberg in Central Europe in that period.
