2 CONT Nobility. Margrave of Austria and Duke of Bavaria. He was the third of the eighteen children of Leopold III and Agnes von Waiblingen. He succeeded his father in 1136 as Margrave of Austria, despite having two older brothers. In 11
2 CONC 39 his uterine half-brother King Konrad III invested him as Duke of Bavaria. As his marriage to Maria of Bohemia remained childless, he was succeeded by his older brother, Heinrich II. Jasomirgott
