1 OCCU Count Palatine of Swabia, Count in the Riesgau, and Freiherr von Büren near Hohenstaffen. Pfalzgraf von Schwaben, Count Palatine of Swabia, Pflazgreve i Schwaben och greve i Riesgau, 
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frederick_von_B%C3%BCren
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.geni.com/people/Friedrich-von-B%C3%BCren-count-palatine-of-Swabia/6000000001744898533
