2 CONT * 2.        ''' RAGNHILD,''' Snorre  records that "Magnus Barefoot's daughter, Ragnhild was married by her brothers to Harald Kesia, a son of the Danish king Eirik the Good"[394].  m HARALD "Kesja" of Denmark, illegitimate son of 
2 CONC ERIK I "Ejegod/the Good" King of Denmark & his mistress --- (-murdered Skibet 1135, bur Skibet churchyard). 
