2 CONT
2 CONT * 6.         '''THORA Magnusdatter''' (-1175).  Snorre names "Jon Loptson, a daughter's son of King Magnus Barefoot", recording that he was at Bergen in 1164 when King Magnus Erlingsson "and Jon's other relations acknowledged the 
2 CONC relationship with him"[442].  m LOFT Sämundsson of Odde.  Later a priest in Iceland. 
