1 NOTE Maria of Antioch, widow of Manuel Comnenus, served as Regent of the Eastern Roman Empire for the brief period after her husband died, for her 12 year old grand son who succeeded briefly.  Maried died 2 years later in 1182.  The bo
2 CONC y was deposed and killed by his uncle.  During her reign as Regent a mob in Constantinople massacred the Latins who ruled as her agents.  The mob killed city officials and traders, and they proclaimed the boy's uncle, Andronicus t
2 CONC o rule as co- emperor.
