1 NOTE Jarl og riksstyrer.
2 CONT 214936910. Baron Erling Jarl SKAKKE was born about 1115 in Stødle, Etne.(11544) He died on 18 Jun 1179 in Kalveskinnet, Trondheim. (11545) He was a Lendemann. He was married to Kristin SIGURDSDTR.
1 NOTE     * OCCUPATION: Jarl
2 CONT     * BIRTH: ABT 1120, Stødle, Etne
2 CONT     * DEATH: 18 Jun 1179, Kalvskinnet, Trondheim 
1 NOTE SOURCE NOTES:
2 CONT http://home.sol.no/~nermo/slekt/d0003/g0000060.html#I1791
2 CONT http://home.sol.no/~torsolhe/valjerd.htm
