1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Ragnhild Erlingsdatter=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of Erling Ormsen "Skakke/ The Sharp" of Studla and Prinsesse av Norge Kristin Sigurdsdatter 
2 CONT * Ragnhild Erlingsdatter (born about 1150) was the daughter of Erling Skakke and Kristin Sigurdsdatter , daughter of Sigurd Jorsalfare . First married to Jon Torbergsson who fell in the battle of the Calfskin 1179 . Married again 
2 CONC to Halkjell Jonsson of Blindheimætten who fell in the Battle of Florvåg 1194 . [1] Grandmother of Magnus Lagabøte .
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT * [http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/NORWAY.htm#RagnhildErlingsdM1JThobergsM2Hallk'''elJons RAGNHILD Erlingsdatter.''']  Snorre names Ragnhild as "a daughter of princess Kristin and Earl Erling who was married to Jon Thorbergson of 
2 CONC Randaberg", recording that she "went away from the country with a man called Grim Rusle…to Constantinople where they were for a time and had some children"[526].  The Saga of King Sverre records the marriage of "Ragnhild daughter 
2 CONC of Earl Erling and Kristin Kings-daughter" and "Halkel son of Jon Hallkelsson"[527].  '''married firstly JON Thorbergsson from Randaberg''' (-killed in battle near Nidaros [Trondheim] 18 or 19 Jun 1179).  '''married secondly HALLK
2 CONC EL Jonsson''' from Blindheim Jarl in Norway, son of JON Hallkelsson & his wife Margrete of Norway [daughter of King Harald Gille] (-killed in battle Florevåg near Bergen 3 Apr 1194). -
2 CONT
