1 NAME Gebhard III. von Zähringen, Bischof von Konstanz
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1052
2 PLAC Konstanz, Germany
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 12 NOV 1110
1 OCCU Bishop of Konstanz
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} references vbm:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gebhard_III._von_Z%C3%A4hringen
2 CONT
2 CONT P.Litta: Famiglie Celebri Italiane, Vol. Supplement5, tab. . Milano, 19?? A.de Ceballos-Escalera Gila: La Casa del Augusto Senor Conde de Barcelona. Cuadernos de Ayala, No.16, 2003
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www8.informatik.uni-erlangen.de/cgi-bin/stoyan/l3/LANG=germ/F=Gebhard/N=v.Konstanz/Q=D:c.1110
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SWABIAN%20NOBILITY.htm#Lancelindiedafter1027A
2 CONT
2 CONT =GEBHARD (-12 Nov 1110).=
2 CONT
2 CONT *Great grandfather: LANCELIN, son of LANZELIN Graf von Altenburg & his wife Lütgard von Nellenburg (-after 1027).  ... same person as…?  LANDOLT (-after 992). 
2 CONT *Grandfather: BEZZELIN [Bertilo] (-15 Jul [1024]). m [LIUTGARD], daughter of ---, patruus of EBERHARD [IV] "dem Seligen" Graf von Nellenburg. 
2 CONT *Father: BERTHOLD (-Limburg 5/6 Nov 1078, bur Hirsau).  m firstly RICHWARA, daughter of --- (-before [1056]). According to Wegener, she was Richwara of Swabia, daughter of Hermann IV Duke of Swabia [Babenberg] & his wife Adelaida 
2 CONC di Susa.  However, this seems unlikely from a chronological point of view.  Richwara gave birth to five children, presumably between [1045/55], so is unlikely to have been born later than 1030, when her supposed father was only 15
2 CONC  years old and her supposed mother about 10.  '''GEBHARD''' (-12 Nov 1110).  The Genealogia Zaringorum names "Gebehardo Constantiensi episcopo" as brother of "Berchtoldus"[634].  The Zwiefaltensis Chronicon names "Gebehardum Const
2 CONC antensem episcopum, Bertolfi ducis germanum" when recording his death "II Id Nov 1110"[635].  The Casus Monasterii Petrishusensis names "Gebehardus vir nobilissimus frater Bertholdi ducis de Zaringin" specifying that he was "prepo
2 CONC situs apud Xantum"[636].  Provost at Xanten.  Monk at Hirsau before 1084.  Bishop of Konstanz 1084-1110.  Papal legate in Germany 1099-1107. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Siblings:===
2 CONT # i)          HERMANN ([1045/48]-Cluny 26 Apr 1074). ...Marchese di Verona... m JUDITH von Calw, daughter of [HESSO] II Graf im Sülchgau Herr von Backnang & his wife --- (-Salerno 27 Sep 1091, bur Backnang). 
2 CONT # ii)         BERTHOLD ([1050]-12 Apr 1111, bur St Peter in Schwarzwald).
2 CONT # iv)        RICHINZA von Spitzenburg (bur Schaffhausen Allerheiligen). ... m firstly --- von Frickingen .  m secondly LUDWIG von Sigmaringen [Helfenstein] (-before 1092). 
2 CONT # v)         LIUTGARDE (-18 Mar [1119]). ... m firstly DIEPOLD [II] von Giengen Markgraf im Nordgau, son of DIETPOLD [I] Graf [von Cham] [Ratpotonen] & his wife --- (-killed in battle near Wellrichstadt 7 Aug 1078).  m secondly ER
2 CONC NST von Grögling Graf von Ottenburg, son of [HARTWICH [II] Graf an der unteren Ampar & his wife Avisa ---] (-12 Jan [1096/97]). 
