2 CONT      Sobeslav I, Duke of Bohemia was born circa 1075. (3) He was the son of Vratislav I, King of Bohemia. (2) He married Adelheid Arpád, daughter of Almus Arpád, Duke of Croatia and Predslava of Kiev, circa 1123. (3) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1140. (3)
2 CONT
2 CONT      Sobeslav I, Duke of Bohemia was a member of the House of Premysl. (2) He succeeded to the title of Duke of Bohemia in 1125. (2)
