2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: 1025 - Novgorod
2 CONT
2 CONT Death: 3 October 1078 - Nezhatina Niva, near Chernigov
2 CONT
2 CONT ---
2 CONT
2 CONT Dynasty: Rurikid
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Yaroslav Vladimirovich "Mudriy/The Wise"
2 CONT
