2 CONT #2. c. 1075: Unnamed daughter ("Synadene") of Theodulos Synadenos and his wife, the sister of the future Byzantine emperor Nikephoros Botaneiates (? – after 1079)  -in Hungarian version they had a daughter 'Katalin'-
