2 CONC ez; 3m: V.1187 Urraca Lopez de Haro (+after 1226) dau.of Cde Lope Diaz de Haro, soberano de Vizcaya and Aldonza Ruiz
2 CONT *** ...
2 CONT **B4. Inft Garcia, *before III.1142, +ca 1146
