2 CONT **B7. Infta Constanza, *1141, +4.10.1160, bur Saint Denis; m.Orleans before 18.11.1153 King Louis VII of France (*1120 +1180)
2 CONT **B8. [2m.] Inft Fernando, *1153/54, +after 1155
2 CONT **B9. [2m.] Infta Sancha, *1155/57, +Sijena 1208; m.Saragosa 1174 King Alfonso II of Aragon (*1157 +1196)
2 CONT **B10. [illegitimate by Gontrada Perez (+1186)] Urraca, *after 1126, +Palencia 12.10.1189; m.Leon 1144 King Garcia VI of Navarre (+1150)
2 CONT **B11. [illegitimate by Sancha Fernandez] Estefania, *after 1150, +murdered 1180; m.1162/64 Fernan Ruiz de Castro (+1185)
