1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Everstein_(Adelsgeschlecht)
2 CONT *
2 CONT
2 CONT ALBERT [IV] von Everstein, son of ALBERT [III] Graf von Everstein & his [first] wife Ryksa of Silesia (-19 Sep before 1217).  Graf von Everstein.  The Chronicle of Alberic de Trois-Fontaines names "Albertum et fraters eius" as chi
2 CONC ldren of "comiti Alberto de Everstein ultra Coliniam" and his wife "Rikissam"[106].
2 CONT
2 CONT m firstly ---.
2 CONT
2 CONT m secondly ([1198/1202]) as her second husband, AGNES von Wittelsbach, widow of GERHARD I Wildgraf in Kyrburg, daughter of OTTO IV Pfalzgraf of Bavaria & his wife Benedikta von Wörth (-5 Mar <nowiki>----</nowiki>).  1172/1219.  Th
2 CONC e Chronicle of Alberic de Trois-Fontaines refers to the wife of "Albertum [filius comiti Alberto de Everstein ultra Coliniam]" as "neptem archiepiscopi Moguntini que fuerat comitissa Silvestris sororem scilicet illius comitis Otto
2 CONC nis de Withhelebac qui interfecit Philippum de Suavia"[107].
2 CONT
2 CONT Graf Albert [IV] & his first wife had five children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.             OTTO von Everstein (-27 Oct 1270).  The Chronicle of Alberic de Trois-Fontaines refers to "Albertum [filius comiti Alberto de Everstein ultra Coliniam]" & his wife having seven sons, the eldest being "Otto…prepositu
2 CONC s Aquensis"[108].  1200.  Provost of St Servatius at Maastricht 1218/22.  Provost of St Maria, Aachen 1218/38 and 1243/70.  Provost at Emmerich 1231/38.  Elected Bishop of Liège 1238/41.  Provost of St Andreas, Köln 1240 and [1249
2 CONC /50]/1270.  Canon at St Lambert, Liège 1249/51.  Archdeacon at Xanten 1266, provost 1266/70.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.             KONRAD [IV] von Everstein (-Brunswick 7 Aug 1256, bur Brunswick St Blasii).  Graf von Everstein.  The Annales Sancti Blasii Brunsvicenses record that "suspensus est comes Conradus de Everstein" by "duce Alberto" in 
2 CONC 1256[109].
2 CONT
2 CONT -        GRAFEN von EVERSTEIN[110].
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.             FRIEDRICH (-after 12 May 1261).  Provost at Nörten 1222.  Provost at Hameln 1234.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4.             LUDWIG [I] (-15 Sep 1284).  Graf von Everstein.  m ADELA von Gleichen, daughter of LAMBERT Graf von Gleichen (-before 1266).
2 CONT
2 CONT -        GRAFEN von EVERSTEIN[111].
2 CONT
2 CONT 5.             HERMANN [I] (-before 1272).  m HEDWIG, daughter of JOHANN Jakobsson & his wife Adelheid von Dassel (-6 Jun 1262).
2 CONT
2 CONT Graf Albert [IV] & his second wife had seven children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 6.             OTTO [I] (-1282 or after).  Graf von Everstein.  m ERMGARD von Arnstein, daughter of WALTER [III] von Arnstein (-24 Dec 1243).
2 CONT
2 CONT -        GRAFEN von EVERSTEIN[112].
2 CONT
2 CONT 7.             HEINRICH .  1219/1245.
2 CONT
2 CONT 8.             ALBERT (-1260 or after).  Provost at Hildesheim 1250.
2 CONT
2 CONT 9.             ADELA (-after 1233).  m BURCHARD [III] Graf von Scharzfeld (-before 28 May 1233).
2 CONT
2 CONT 10.         CLEMENTIA .  1231/1257.  m (before 15 May 1231) LUDOLF [IV] Graf von Dassel (-before 1238).
2 CONT
2 CONT 11.         BENEDIKTA .  1235/1283.  m GOTTSCHALK von Plesse .  1200/1253.
2 CONT
2 CONT 12.         SOPHIE .  1250/1272.  m (1227) HERMANN [I] Graf von Woldenberg (-[14 Mar 1243/Jul 1244]).
2 CONT
