2 CONT **F2. [2m.] '''King Salomon of Hungary''' (1063-74) -cr (twice) 1057 and 1063, *1052, +k.a.(Balkan) 1087; '''m'''.1063 Judith-Maria of Germany (*1047, +ca 1100)
2 CONT ***G1. [https://www.geni.com/people/%C3%81RP%C3%81D-h%C3%A1zi-Sophia/6000000011657190041 Zsófia], +ca 1110; '''m'''. Count Poppo von Berg
