2 CONC 054 Bretislaus issued the famous Seniority Law. For the first time this act stated that Bohemia and Moravia would pass directly through the senior line of the Přemyslid dynasty. Younger members of the dynasty were allowed to gover
2 CONC n Moravia, but only at the Duke's discretion.
