2 CONT <td valign=top><table border="1" align="center" width="220"><tr><td bgcolor=ffffff><img src="http://www.renderplus.com/hartgen/images/germany/EmperorHeinrich-III.jpg"alt="Image of Emperor Henry III of Germany" width="200" align="c
