2 CONT Mieszko II Lambert, King of Poland (1) M, #152262, d. 1034 Last Edited=30 Jul 2005
2 CONT      Mieszko II Lambert, King of Poland was the son of Boleslaw I, King of Poland. (1)  He died in 1034. (1)
2 CONT      Mieszko II Lambert, King of Poland was a member of the House of Piast. (1) He succeeded to the title of King Mieszko II of Poland in 1025. (1) Child of Mieszko II Lambert, King of Poland -1. Casimir I, Duke of Poland+ b. 1016
2 CONC , d. 1058 (1)
2 CONT
