2 CONT
2 CONT Hertug (Duke) Knut VALDEMARSEN Denmark, born Bef. 1221 in DENMARK; died October 15, 1260;
2 CONT
2 CONT married (1) Hedvig [Patronym unkn.] av Brandenburg; married (2) Hertuginne (Dutchess) Ingegerd [Patronym
2 CONT
2 CONT unkn.] av Pommeren.
