1 NOTE The House of Vojislav was a medieval dynasty that inherited the claims over Duklja of the old ruling House of Saint Vladimir and the Serbian House of Vlastimir dynasty. It ruled Duklja and the surrounding territories; including Za
2 CONC humlje, Rascia and Bosnia, where the dynasty's side branches have become rulers. 
2 CONT It lasted from 1034 until 1186, when it was transformed into the House of Nemanja.
1 NOTE levde 1130.
1 NOTE 867789546. Fyrste/Storzupan Stefan UROSCH av Serbia was born about 1081.(20769) He died about 1149.(20770) He was a Fyrste in Serbia.(20771) (20772) Storzupan under navnet "Urosch I." over det østlige Serbien. I fevr. 1094 gav den
2 CONC  daværende storzupan Vikan tyve gisler til keiser Alezios, deriblant sine to nevøer Urosch og Stephan Vikan, Disse to støttet enkelte tronpretendenter og styrtet kong Lobroslav II, som etterfulgte kong Bodin (1082 til 1104/8). Uro
2 CONC sch etterfulgte Vikan (som ennda i 1106 var storzupan) antaglig 1108/18. Selv etterfulgtes han av Urosch II som i 1149 var storzupan. He was married.
