2 CONT     * Alice (d.1200), married Hugh III, Duke of Burgundy
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Thierry (d.1181), bishop of Metz (1174-1179)
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Matthias (d.1208), count of Toul
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Unnamed daughter who died young
2 CONT
