2 CONT
2 CONT Thimo Markgraf von Kistritz
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #8887, d. 9 March 1104
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=9 Feb 2003
2 CONT
2 CONT      Thimo Markgraf von Kistritz was the son of Dietrich II Markgraf von Ostmark and Mathilde von Meißen. He died on 9 March 1104.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Thimo Markgraf von Kistritz gained the title of Graf von Brehna. He gained the title of Graf von Wettin. He gained the title of Margraf von Kistritz.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Thimo Markgraf von Kistritz and Ida von Nordheim
2 CONT
2 CONT -1. Dedo IV Graf von Brehna+ b. c 1086, d. 16 Dec 1124
2 CONT
2 CONT -2. Conrad Markgraf von Meißen+ b. c 1098, d. 5 Feb 1157
2 CONT
2 CONT -3. Maud von Kistritz b. c 1100, d. c 1125
