2 CONC Stammliste der Askanier"
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Saxon Annals refer to him as Otto "The Great", Otto "the Red", or Otto "the Rich" as well.
2 CONT
2 CONT First Prince of Ascania to call himself Count of Anhalt.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Briefly Duke of Saxony.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marries around 1095.
