2 CONT Family
2 CONT He was married twice[5]:
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1285 in Eger (Cheb), he married Judith of Habsburg (1271-1297), daughter of Rudolph I of Germany and his wife Gertrude of Hohenburg. She died shortly after their 10th child was born:
