3 CONT managed to delete what the computer would let me, but there are still 4 of the same painting, and
3 CONT they were posted before yours. Would you please help clean up this profile and delete the
3 CONT copy of the painting you added. I am making this request to all of the Geni members who
3 CONT did not check to see if a painting already exsisted before adding another one, please
3 CONT always check. Thanks so much.
3 CONT Janet Milburn
3 CONT 11/14/19
