2 CONC utonic Knights. Music for the film was written by Sergei Prokofiev, who also reworked the score into a concert cantata. At Stalin's insistence, the film was rushed into theaters and the resulting sound recording was notably disapp
2 CONC ointing, while the visual images were quite impressive, especially in the spectacular battle on the ice.
