1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Oleg Vladimirovich (d. before 1217) - prince of Pronsk (from 1207- till before 1217), son of Vladimir Glebovich.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1207, together with his brother Gleb, Oleg slandered other Ryazan princes in front of Vsevolod "the Big Nest", as a result of which their uncles Roman, Svyatoslav Gleboviches and cousins ​​Ingvar and Yuri Igoreviches were captu
2 CONC red. Together with the army of prince Vladimir, Oleg participated in the siege of Pronsk, repulsed the deblocking blow organized by his cousin Roman Igorevich and received the Principality of Pronsk.
2 CONT
2 CONT Information about Oleg's family and descendants has not been preserved.
