2 CONC alomon[475].  The Kronika Węgiersko-Polska names "Geyzam et Ladislaum" as the two older sons of "Bela" and his wife "rex Polonie filiam", adding that they were both born in Poland[476].  He succeeded his cousin in 1074 as GÉZA I K
2 CONC ing of Hungary.  
