2 CONC de Castilla, in 1198. (3) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1204. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT      Emeric Arpád, King of Hungary held the office of Co-regent of Hungary between 1185 and 1196. (4) He gained the title of King Emeric of Hungary in 1196. (1)
2 CONT
