2 CONT ==BÉLA III 1172-1196==
2 CONT m firstly (1172) AGNES de Châtillon-sur-Loing ... She adopted the name ANNA in Hungary
2 CONT Betrothed (after Sep 1185) to THEODORA Komnene m secondly ([1185/86]) as her second husband, MARGUERITE de France Ctss de Vexin King Béla III & his first wife had six children:
2 CONT * 1.         IMRE (1174-30 Nov 1204, Eger Cathedral).  ...
2 CONT * 2.         MARGIT (1175-after 3 Mar 1229). ... She adopted the name MARIA in Byzantium. m firstly (1185) as his second wife, Emperor ISAAKIOS II ''(+2 marrieges)''
2 CONT * 3.         ANDRÁS (1176-21 Sep 1235
2 CONT * 4.         '''SALAMON (-young).'''
2 CONT * 5.         ISTVÁN (-young).
2 CONT * 6.         CONSTANZA ([1180]-Kloster Tichnowitz 6 Dec 1240).  ... Betrothed ([1189]) to FRIEDRICH VI Duke of Swabia ... m (1198) as his second wife, PŘEMYSL OTAKAR I King of Bohemia
