1 NOTE 214936924. Hertug Leopold V HENRIKSON av Østerike(11591) was born in 1157.(11592) He was a Hertug between 1177 and 1194 in Østerike. (11593) He died on 31 Dec 1194.(11594) Begravet i Heilingenburg. Han utmerket seg på det tredje 
2 CONC korstok ven inntagelsen av Ptolemais, men han kom derved istrid med den engelske konge Richard Læveherte. og hevnet seg senere ved å ta kongen til fange, da denne på tilbakereisen dro gjennom hans land, og tiltvang seg derved st
2 CONC ore løspenger. Dessuten knyttet han 1192 Steiermark til sitt hertugdømme. He was married to Helena GEISASDTR av Ungarn in 1174.
1 NOTE Leopold V became the 2nd duke of Austria, and succeeded his father as Sovereign of the Empire of Austria in 1177.  Leopold V ruled until 1194.  He was succeeded by his son, Frederick I.
1 NOTE He wasa Duke of Osterrike 1177-1194. He made Richard Lionhgeart a prisoner and
2 CONT demanded ransom to let him go.
