0 @N6000000002322323316@ NOTE He was the illegitimate elder brother of Boleslaw III. Each son of Wlayslaw I
1 CONT the Herman ruled a Polish province during their father's lifetime. Boleslaw
1 CONT III succeeded to his father's princely title (no Polish ruler assumed the
1 CONT title of king form 1082 to 1296) and spent the next several years in fighting
1 CONT Zbigniew for control of the country. After repelling an invasion of Silesia
1 CONT in 1109, and by the German king Henry V, Boleslaw recalled the exiled
1 CONT Zbigmiew in 1112, later accusing him of treason & having him blinded.
