0 @N6000000002187651095@ NOTE Judith of Swabia
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT Judith of Swabia (1047 - 1093/1095) was the daughter of the Holy Roman Emperor Henry III and Agnes de Poitou.
1 CONT
1 CONT She was first married to Solomon of Hungary and then to Ladislaus I Herman, duke of Poland, the father of Boleslaw III of Poland. When she married she changed her name to Sophia von Hungary.
