1 CONC ncipatus terrae), and during his time Austrian common law is mentioned for the first time, another proof of the developing national consciousness.
1 CONT Leopold's reputation with the clergy was high, and he was eventually canonized (1485). He gave generous endowments to religious communities, establishing the Cistercians at Heiligenkreuz, and he founded, or at least restored, the 
