1 CONT (Vladimir I Weis 147-23, St. Vladimir in 241-4)   Grand Prince of Kiev, m. aft. 1011. a dau. of Kono, Count of Ohningen, by Richilde, dau. of OTTO I, the Great (147-19); m. also Rogneide, dau. of Rognald of Polotzk. )Weis 241-5).(
1 CONC Wies 147-23-w.f).
